e","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"C++11〜C++20 と書くと C++15 や C++19 もありそう","ts":"1620803018.422400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R=F3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"def57066-a87d-42e5-bdf2-4c6091848cc1","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://zenn.dev/tetsurom/books/cpp11-cpp20-for-game-developers|https://zenn.dev/tetsurom/books/cpp11-cpp20-for-game-developers\u003e","ts":"1620802841.421800","attachments":[{"fallback":"Zenn: ゲーム開発者のための C++11〜C++20 技術書典 10 Ver.","id":1,"title":"ゲーム開発者のための C++11〜C++20 技術書典 10 Ver.","title_link":"https://zenn.dev/tetsurom/books/cpp11-cpp20-for-game-developers","text":"◆ 内容 本書は、2020 年 9 月に開催された CEDEC 2020 講演「ゲーム開発者のための C++11～C++20, 将来の C++ の展望」で取り上げた C++11～C++20 機能を解説し、説明や項目、サンプルを加筆した本です。 CEDEC ではスライドの面積の都合","image_url":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dlhzyuewr/image/upload/s--JIjEhMj5--/g_center%2Ch_280%2Cl_fetch:aHR0cHM6Ly9zdG9yYWdlLmdvb2dsZWFwaXMuY29tL3plbm4tdXNlci11cGxvYWQvYm9va19jb3Zlci9iZjNhMzU2ZjFlLmpwZw==%2Cw_200/v1604564438/og_book_base_ndpqis.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"Zenn","service_icon":"https://zenn.dev/images/icon.png","from_url":"https://zenn.dev/tetsurom/books/cpp11-cpp20-for-game-developers","original_url":"https://zenn.dev/tetsurom/books/cpp11-cpp20-for-game-developers"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"avX5u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"182C1EB2-B4BD-49C8-8F62-AB55C5CFC7E4","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"チェインさせる副次的なメリットととしては、オーバーライドが簡単そうです(CoR)。ゾンビ系が対象ならば、HealをGiveDamageに派生させる、みたいなことができる……予定です","ts":"1620788606.421000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"blo+H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"EF71361C-CDE4-46D9-976D-4C85D470ED66","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"僕は複製・同期のアイデアは持っていませんでした。現在はイベントからイベントを派生させるやり方なので\n(MeleeAttack-\u0026gt;Hit-\u0026gt;GiveDamageなど)\nイベントを返す-\u0026gt;演出-\u0026gt;次のイベントをチェイン、という形でターン制を作っています","ts":"1620788470.418600","edited":{"user":"U012MBD7MFZ","ts":"1620788506.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SiS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4A247900-BC99-4C9B-A62A-481D105F0468","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"違いとしては、一時的に内部状態を複製するみたい？","ts":"1620788354.416000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QJ6+7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E78D486D-B01B-47A0-A5D5-4EAFA3B8EF58","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"この記事も似たような内容で　\u003chttp://www.lancarse.co.jp/blog/?p=194|http://www.lancarse.co.jp/blog/?p=194\u003e","ts":"1620788328.415300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hwr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5D26E5FC-ECFA-46FE-804C-D9563B5E1541","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"内部状態を2つ持っておく。片方は、一気に時間を進める。もう片方は演出に使う(変更イベントのキュー／グラフを使って同期する)\nみたいな内容だったと思います","ts":"1620788285.414900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H9O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C3D5D4AA-13D0-4743-BF69-C5423DEA4DC7","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"流れてきたターン制実装の記事を読みました　\u003chttps://www.boxdragon.se/blog/three-worlds|https://www.boxdragon.se/blog/three-worlds\u003e","ts":"1620788156.412300","attachments":[{"fallback":"Box Dragon: Three-Worlds Theory: Art or Gameplay? Pick Two. — Box Dragon","id":1,"title":"Three-Worlds Theory: Art or Gameplay? Pick Two. — Box Dragon","title_link":"https://www.boxdragon.se/blog/three-worlds","text":"A Three-World design decouples gameplay rules from visuals to allow turn-based games to playback animation sequences in parallel or even reorder them entirely!","thumb_url":"http://static1.squarespace.com/static/5e78cd9c589b293c96b1815e/5fbc05106a2d8d65edd1016d/5fbc05106a2d8d65edd1016e/1620660384450/ThreeWorlds+Thumb.png?format=1500w","blocks":null,"service_name":"Box Dragon","service_icon":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5e78cd9c589b293c96b1815e/1587045146286-6DZ54RQ2YNU3DFXPRFK9/ke17ZwdGBToddI8pDm48kJ4J8uKDiZK-F_5B0JN0McZZw-zPPgdn4jUwVcJE1ZvWhcwhEtWJXoshNdA9f1qD7ewC-od9ZuPSBWOQvaZcUlYGDhblyeQL85DWG_sW70nLYQxFLK614c0JQ6x_hp_ydg/favicon.ico?format=100w","thumb_width":1200,"thumb_height":1200,"from_url":"https://www.boxdragon.se/blog/three-worlds","original_url":"https://www.boxdragon.se/blog/three-worlds"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8cp"}]}]
